  BEGUN --> BLOCKED: precommit 실패 및 rollback
  ATTEMPT --> APPLIED: commit와 fence 재검사 성공
  ATTEMPT --> REPLAYED: 응답 유실 뒤 exact receipt 확인
  ATTEMPT --> BLOCKED: receipt 모호 또는 semantic postcommit 오류
